    "created_at": "2018-09-13T22:00:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-09-13T22:05:59Z",
    "body": "> At the extreme pairing could be burned into the firmware\r\n\r\nHow? WebUSB hardware does not know the URI of the website it's communicating with. Or are you suggesting we should come up with our own authentication scheme (and thus requiring the server to store some kind of secret)?",
